<section class="how-to-use" id="how-to-use">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">三步轻松养发，懒人也能坚持</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-img"><img src="{{ 'slide9_img7_30.png' | asset_url }}" alt="起泡"></div>
        <div class="step-number">01</div>
        <h3>搓泡</h3>
        <p>养发皂充分打湿，用起泡网或手搓出绵密泡沫。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-img"><img src="{{ 'slide9_img8_31.png' | asset_url }}" alt="按摩"></div>
        <div class="step-number">02</div>
        <h3>按摩</h3>
        <p>泡沫抹在头皮和头发上，指腹打圈按摩3-5分钟。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-img"><img src="{{ 'slide9_img9_32.png' | asset_url }}" alt="冲洗"></div>
        <div class="step-number">03</div>
        <h3>冲净</h3>
        <p>用温水把泡沫彻底冲干净，头皮清爽无残留。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.how-to-use { padding: 80px 0; background: #f8f9f0; }
.steps-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  gap: 28px;
}
.step-card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 36px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}
.step-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.step-img { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.step-img img { width: 160px; height: 160px; border-radius: 16px; object-fit: cover; }
.step-number {
  font-size: 36px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--brand);
  opacity: 0.3;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.step-card h3 { font-size: 20px; color: var(--brand-dark); margin-bottom: 8px; }
.step-card p { font-size: var(--body-small); color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }
</style>

